      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 47,
      "outputTokens": 334,
      "costUsd": 0.0030295,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's the idea in one line. Only what's left after the interest pays the loan down. A bigger repayment leaves more. A higher rate leaves less. And if nothing's left, the loan never shrinks."
    },
